		<category><![CDATA[billionaires]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[election]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://techcrunch.com/?p=3183699</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[California voters rejected Proposition 40, the one-time 5% tax on billionaires, the AP reported Monday. Tech leaders outspent backers roughly 10 to 1 to defeat it, and the founders and economists TechCrunch interviewed before the vote were split on whether it would have driven out wealthy residents or just trimmed their fortunes.]]></description>
		
		
		
